WEBVTT

00:00:01.040 --> 00:00:07.420
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:01:32.970 --> 00:01:34.130
To find the legendary cookware,

00:01:34.180 --> 00:01:35.850
we set foot on the journey.

00:01:36.020 --> 00:01:37.580
The first stop is Shanghai.

00:01:38.250 --> 00:01:39.000
While we were

00:01:39.050 --> 00:01:39.530
in the joy of

00:01:39.580 --> 00:01:40.920
reuniting with Sanjie,

00:01:41.410 --> 00:01:44.250
the Dark Cooking Society has reached Shanghai

00:01:44.760 --> 00:01:46.810
and held Sanjie’s father as hostage.

00:01:47.150 --> 00:01:48.340
They challenged us

00:01:48.390 --> 00:01:49.840
with a battle of cooking.

00:02:00.810 --> 00:02:02.110
The battle will be at midnight tonight,

00:02:02.460 --> 00:02:04.370
at a ship on Huangpu River.

00:02:05.270 --> 00:02:06.020
Liu Maoxing.

00:02:06.400 --> 00:02:08.340
Bring the maps on you.

00:02:11.870 --> 00:02:14.100
Please take off the blindfolds.

00:02:15.240 --> 00:02:16.280
Have we arrived?

00:02:22.230 --> 00:02:23.280
The headquarters of the Dark Cooking Society.

00:02:23.400 --> 00:02:24.310
Loulin Palace.

00:02:31.920 --> 00:02:35.560
Huge Floating Cooking Arena!
Magical Power of the Iron Arm Soup

00:02:47.530 --> 00:02:49.060
This way, please.

00:02:53.440 --> 00:02:54.680
There must be all enemies here.

00:02:54.730 --> 00:02:55.370
Certainly.

00:02:55.530 --> 00:02:56.230
There could be hundreds,

00:02:56.280 --> 00:02:57.670
or thousands of enemies.

00:02:57.810 --> 00:02:59.440
If we can make it alive,

00:02:59.490 --> 00:03:00.340
that would be lucky of us.

00:03:01.180 --> 00:03:01.880
No!

00:03:02.160 --> 00:03:03.690
Let's go back.

00:03:03.860 --> 00:03:04.870
This is a rare opportunity.

00:03:05.770 --> 00:03:06.620
Lei En.

00:03:09.130 --> 00:03:09.880
The Dark Cooking Society

00:03:09.930 --> 00:03:11.370
tries to make people

00:03:11.580 --> 00:03:12.850
submit to them

00:03:13.550 --> 00:03:14.650
through cooking.

00:03:15.010 --> 00:03:16.120
Thus, the thing that can destroy them

00:03:16.170 --> 00:03:16.920
is our uprightness and justice.

00:03:17.750 --> 00:03:18.970
Today, we finally have a chance

00:03:19.020 --> 00:03:20.490
to see the Dark Cooking Society.

00:03:21.620 --> 00:03:22.970
It’s a great chance.

00:03:23.830 --> 00:03:24.950
But...

00:03:26.670 --> 00:03:27.550
Why do I feel like

00:03:27.850 --> 00:03:29.810
walking in hell?

00:03:31.670 --> 00:03:32.640
It’s grim.

00:03:34.720 --> 00:03:36.280
Are you scared by this?

00:03:36.330 --> 00:03:38.290
You are a girl after all.

00:03:38.460 --> 00:03:39.440
What are you talking about?

00:03:39.530 --> 00:03:40.420
Who just cried

00:03:40.470 --> 00:03:42.230
and wanted to go back?

00:03:43.870 --> 00:03:44.950
It’s fine. Meili.

00:03:45.480 --> 00:03:47.400
We have Chef Xie and Lei En with us.

00:03:47.780 --> 00:03:48.900
Yes.

00:03:49.380 --> 00:03:50.480
And you have me,

00:03:50.530 --> 00:03:52.510
Silang, a true man.

00:03:52.850 --> 00:03:53.670
The Dark Cooking Society or what,

00:03:53.710 --> 00:03:55.550
it doesn’t matter.

00:04:03.900 --> 00:04:05.150
Help! Mao!

00:04:05.200 --> 00:04:06.770
Silang. Be quiet.

00:04:08.150 --> 00:04:09.580
You are really strange.

00:04:09.630 --> 00:04:11.200
Why do you take in such an apprentice?

00:04:13.670 --> 00:04:15.150
Hey, how far do we

00:04:15.200 --> 00:04:15.820
have to go?

00:04:16.120 --> 00:04:17.280
We are not here

00:04:17.330 --> 00:04:18.960
for sightseeing.

00:04:20.870 --> 00:04:22.040
This is the place.

00:04:27.000 --> 00:04:28.600
You guys do have some balls.

00:04:30.150 --> 00:04:32.370
Come in to our arena.

00:04:34.410 --> 00:04:35.910
Is it The King of Hell

00:04:35.960 --> 00:04:37.890
sitting in this room?

00:05:04.910 --> 00:05:05.940
It is

00:05:06.040 --> 00:05:07.990
such a big cooking arena on the ship.

00:05:13.900 --> 00:05:16.440
But they all look horrifying.

00:05:17.150 --> 00:05:19.430
They are from the Dark Cooking Society.

00:05:19.660 --> 00:05:21.460
Where is my father?

00:05:21.600 --> 00:05:22.480
Where is he?

00:05:29.220 --> 00:05:30.860
You know what we want,

00:05:30.970 --> 00:05:32.380
don't you?

00:05:33.190 --> 00:05:34.860
The legendary cookware.

00:05:35.790 --> 00:05:37.860
But we won’t take it from the Shanghai cooking world

00:05:37.910 --> 00:05:40.350
for no reason.

00:05:41.280 --> 00:05:44.390
So, we arranged this battle

00:05:44.570 --> 00:05:45.390
to compete for it,

00:05:45.440 --> 00:05:46.670
fair and square.

00:05:48.020 --> 00:05:49.400
You held hostages.

00:05:49.490 --> 00:05:50.890
Is it fair and square?

00:05:51.040 --> 00:05:52.260
Let my father go right now!

00:05:54.080 --> 00:05:56.320
Hostage? That’s a harsh word.

00:05:57.120 --> 00:05:59.660
The Elders are resting in their rooms.

00:06:00.080 --> 00:06:01.090
After the competition,

00:06:01.230 --> 00:06:02.630
they can leave with you.

00:06:02.820 --> 00:06:03.230
At least

00:06:03.280 --> 00:06:04.520
let me know they are safe.

00:06:04.570 --> 00:06:05.710
Right now.

00:06:05.760 --> 00:06:07.810
Your father provided us

00:06:07.870 --> 00:06:09.820
the location of the cookware.

00:06:11.010 --> 00:06:13.620
A thing like this.

00:06:14.310 --> 00:06:15.200
But this alone

00:06:15.250 --> 00:06:16.580
won’t tell us anything.

00:06:17.090 --> 00:06:18.010
Do you bring the maps

00:06:18.060 --> 00:06:21.290
that can decipher it?

00:06:26.360 --> 00:06:27.910
Yes, as you asked.

00:06:28.130 --> 00:06:28.800
Is it the one?

00:06:41.200 --> 00:06:42.190
The code. The map.

00:06:42.470 --> 00:06:44.370
The winner will take them both.

00:06:44.700 --> 00:06:46.560
Let’s compete. The Dark Cooking Society.

00:06:47.180 --> 00:06:47.910
You are brave.

00:06:48.620 --> 00:06:51.630
The Cooking Competition at Loulin Palace

00:06:51.670 --> 00:06:52.280
on Huangpu River begins now.

00:06:53.160 --> 00:06:55.190
The chefs,

00:06:55.380 --> 00:06:56.300
four from each side,

00:06:56.860 --> 00:06:58.240
will make soup, dim sum,

00:06:58.350 --> 00:06:59.190
and two main dishes.

00:06:59.240 --> 00:07:00.120
Four kinds of food in total.

00:07:00.530 --> 00:07:01.670
The side that wins more stars

00:07:01.720 --> 00:07:03.000
will be the winner.

00:07:03.750 --> 00:07:04.530
Wait!

00:07:04.990 --> 00:07:05.800
You said four chefs each side.

00:07:05.850 --> 00:07:07.470
Aren’t you short of one person?

00:07:07.610 --> 00:07:08.700
Take it easy.

00:07:09.030 --> 00:07:11.580
One more person will come soon.

00:07:12.140 --> 00:07:13.580
One more person?

00:07:15.320 --> 00:07:17.460
The first round is about soup.

00:07:25.940 --> 00:07:27.920
Let me do this.

00:07:39.060 --> 00:07:40.610
Look at his hand!

00:07:57.460 --> 00:08:00.190
I’m Multicoloured Tiger Luo Ke of the Dark Cooking Society.

00:08:00.810 --> 00:08:02.530
Who will compete with me?

00:08:04.650 --> 00:08:05.610
I’ve never seen anyone

00:08:05.660 --> 00:08:07.060
who uses that kind of thing.

00:08:07.390 --> 00:08:08.990
He is a mechanical chef.

00:08:09.530 --> 00:08:11.930
Will we compete with such a strange person?

00:08:13.230 --> 00:08:14.520
Who should we send for this?

00:08:14.760 --> 00:08:15.620
Interesting.

00:08:16.090 --> 00:08:18.430
Tiger or whatever,

00:08:18.690 --> 00:08:20.520
I’m the Super Dim Sum Master

00:08:20.570 --> 00:08:22.040
in the Continent.

00:08:23.730 --> 00:08:24.360
Chef Xie.

00:08:24.920 --> 00:08:26.400
Let me do this round.

00:08:27.490 --> 00:08:28.200
Sanjie.

00:08:28.830 --> 00:08:30.140
The legendary cookware

00:08:30.260 --> 00:08:31.320
is a symbol that Shanghai leads

00:08:31.370 --> 00:08:32.530
the other regions in cooking.

00:08:33.130 --> 00:08:34.130
This competition

00:08:34.180 --> 00:08:34.930
bets on the legendary cookware.

00:08:35.330 --> 00:08:37.790
It’s also to defend the Shanghai cooking world.

00:08:38.430 --> 00:08:40.350
Please let me take the lead.

00:08:43.440 --> 00:08:44.150
Whatever you are,

00:08:44.360 --> 00:08:45.270
let's begin.

00:08:45.400 --> 00:08:47.290
Before the competition,

00:08:47.340 --> 00:08:48.530
let me introduce the judges.

00:08:58.600 --> 00:09:00.690
No way! Aren’t you...

00:09:01.040 --> 00:09:02.240
Who are they?

00:09:02.460 --> 00:09:03.700
Do you know them?

00:09:04.060 --> 00:09:06.070
He’s the boss of the market,

00:09:06.180 --> 00:09:06.830
Lord Zhang.

00:09:07.570 --> 00:09:09.380
That’s the chief sailors, Lord Hu.

00:09:10.020 --> 00:09:11.270
He’s the president of the trade union,

00:09:11.540 --> 00:09:12.340
Lord He.

00:09:13.150 --> 00:09:14.140
The other two

00:09:14.400 --> 00:09:16.040
are also leaders

00:09:16.260 --> 00:09:18.230
of Shanghai’s guilds.

00:09:20.660 --> 00:09:22.500
Shanghai is a new city.

00:09:22.860 --> 00:09:24.020
Many systems

00:09:24.080 --> 00:09:25.420
are still being formulated.

00:09:26.540 --> 00:09:27.670
Thus,

00:09:27.980 --> 00:09:29.550
to guard their own streets,

00:09:29.770 --> 00:09:31.790
the citizens set up various guilds,

00:09:36.770 --> 00:09:38.880
including the Cooking League,

00:09:38.950 --> 00:09:39.890
one of the many.

00:09:40.950 --> 00:09:41.960
But they...

00:09:42.360 --> 00:09:43.020
Why?

00:09:43.440 --> 00:09:43.850
Why are you

00:09:43.900 --> 00:09:45.090
working with the Dark Cooking Society now?

00:09:45.650 --> 00:09:46.450
Hadn’t you worked

00:09:46.700 --> 00:09:47.740
with the League

00:09:47.790 --> 00:09:49.010
in the past?

00:09:49.700 --> 00:09:50.750
Why are you doing this?

00:09:54.950 --> 00:09:57.090
Listen up.

00:09:57.560 --> 00:09:58.680
As long as we can

00:09:58.720 --> 00:10:00.860
dominate the Shanghai cooking world,

00:10:01.310 --> 00:10:03.480
whether the League or the Dark Cooking Society,

00:10:03.650 --> 00:10:04.950
it doesn’t matter.

00:10:05.690 --> 00:10:06.410
What did you say?

00:10:07.590 --> 00:10:10.130
Yes. As long as the strongest one leads

00:10:10.180 --> 00:10:12.230
to keep Shanghai in order,

00:10:12.390 --> 00:10:13.590
anyone can do it.

00:10:14.090 --> 00:10:16.660
Moreover, in the Dark Cooking Society,

00:10:16.760 --> 00:10:18.160
there are many talents

00:10:18.210 --> 00:10:20.230
even better than Super Chefs.

00:10:20.480 --> 00:10:21.460
They may bring more benefits

00:10:21.510 --> 00:10:24.690
to Shanghai. Right?

00:10:28.040 --> 00:10:29.470
Today, we are gonna

00:10:29.610 --> 00:10:31.210
see their unparalleled skills

00:10:31.270 --> 00:10:33.080
for ourselves.

00:10:33.300 --> 00:10:34.840
Let me make it clear. Sanjie.

00:10:34.970 --> 00:10:36.500
We will honestly choose

00:10:36.550 --> 00:10:39.080
the side with better cooking.

00:10:39.640 --> 00:10:40.700
We won’t favor you

00:10:40.750 --> 00:10:42.750
just because we know you.

00:10:42.900 --> 00:10:44.140
It looks like, in Shanghai,

00:10:44.420 --> 00:10:46.330
power means justice.

00:10:46.840 --> 00:10:47.540
Sanjie.

00:10:48.710 --> 00:10:49.350
I see.

00:10:49.930 --> 00:10:50.900
While the Dark Cooking Society

00:10:51.100 --> 00:10:52.510
tries to gain the cookware,

00:10:52.560 --> 00:10:54.050
they also wanna control Shanghai.

00:10:55.660 --> 00:10:56.810
No more talk.

00:10:56.860 --> 00:10:58.050
Let’s get started.

00:10:58.240 --> 00:11:00.330
I can’t wait any longer.

00:11:00.910 --> 00:11:03.520
Okay. Please go to your positions.

00:11:13.880 --> 00:11:15.690
The first round is about soup.

00:11:16.040 --> 00:11:17.330
You can use any ingredients

00:11:17.380 --> 00:11:19.250
or tools here.

00:11:20.130 --> 00:11:22.350
The competition begins.

00:11:28.220 --> 00:11:29.950
Will so many chickens be used?

00:11:39.200 --> 00:11:41.000
What is he going to do?

00:11:42.860 --> 00:11:45.030
Arhat Tiger Claw.

00:11:56.130 --> 00:11:58.050
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:12:08.070 --> 00:12:10.010
What is he going to do?

00:12:11.730 --> 00:12:13.850
Arhat Tiger Claw.

00:12:35.730 --> 00:12:38.310
Arhat Tiger Claw is awesome.

00:12:40.190 --> 00:12:42.440
Five chickens are cleaned at once.

00:12:43.880 --> 00:12:46.840
Even the tiniest feathers are cleaned.

00:13:01.020 --> 00:13:04.440
Removing feathers and bones, cutting meat,

00:13:05.220 --> 00:13:06.560
he didn’t use any knife.

00:13:06.610 --> 00:13:08.320
It’s easily done with his iron hand.

00:13:09.160 --> 00:13:10.250
What is this skill?

00:13:10.970 --> 00:13:12.790
This isn’t that easy.

00:13:25.350 --> 00:13:27.420
Let me show you

00:13:27.530 --> 00:13:29.100
how delicious the soup will be

00:13:29.300 --> 00:13:31.310
cooked with my sharp claw.

00:13:35.440 --> 00:13:37.760
Five whole chickens all in the pot!

00:13:38.710 --> 00:13:40.100
That’s really amazing.

00:13:40.690 --> 00:13:42.010
He added five whole chickens

00:13:42.060 --> 00:13:45.020
into the chicken soup prepared beforehand.

00:13:46.390 --> 00:13:49.210
The soup stewed that way must be great.

00:13:50.710 --> 00:13:52.590
I’m looking forward to it.

00:13:53.370 --> 00:13:55.060
It’s not good, Mao.

00:13:55.110 --> 00:13:55.630
But

00:13:55.930 --> 00:13:58.630
he prepared the soup beforehand.

00:13:58.680 --> 00:13:59.380
It’s unfair.

00:13:59.950 --> 00:14:00.820
You’re right.

00:14:01.040 --> 00:14:02.580
You are so mean.

00:14:02.800 --> 00:14:05.380
You prepared the soup beforehand.

00:14:05.840 --> 00:14:07.000
It’s unfair!

00:14:07.050 --> 00:14:07.890
Stop shouting.

00:14:08.700 --> 00:14:09.870
Don’t mess around here.

00:14:10.560 --> 00:14:11.320
These guys

00:14:11.370 --> 00:14:12.700
are known for their dirty tricks.

00:14:13.130 --> 00:14:15.750
Our duty is to defeat them.

00:14:16.310 --> 00:14:18.070
Yes. Silang. Meili.

00:14:18.540 --> 00:14:19.870
This is a competition.

00:14:23.060 --> 00:14:23.860
How is it?

00:14:24.020 --> 00:14:25.520
Young Master of Longzhen Restaurant.

00:14:25.800 --> 00:14:28.520
You haven’t started yet.

00:14:28.850 --> 00:14:31.060
Are you terrified

00:14:31.110 --> 00:14:31.810
by my Arhat Tiger Claw?

00:14:32.030 --> 00:14:34.000
You can surrender now.

00:14:36.510 --> 00:14:37.660
Sanjie.

00:14:37.910 --> 00:14:39.110
Is he okay?

00:14:39.740 --> 00:14:41.600
Is he shocked by the fact

00:14:41.650 --> 00:14:42.930
that the leaders join hands

00:14:43.440 --> 00:14:44.800
with the Dark Cooking Society?

00:14:45.860 --> 00:14:47.720
Why do you have that look?

00:14:49.680 --> 00:14:50.880
In Shanghai,

00:14:51.630 --> 00:14:53.070
whether my skills are good or not,

00:14:53.180 --> 00:14:56.320
many people like my cooking.

00:14:56.980 --> 00:14:58.450
To see their smile,

00:14:58.580 --> 00:15:00.320
I’ve been working hard to use knives.

00:15:04.660 --> 00:15:05.610
It’s all because

00:15:05.770 --> 00:15:07.940
you made me realize that

00:15:08.470 --> 00:15:09.700
it's great to be a chef.

00:15:11.010 --> 00:15:12.050
That was the first time

00:15:12.300 --> 00:15:14.010
I cooked so happily.

00:15:33.230 --> 00:15:34.640
Cook with smile.

00:15:34.920 --> 00:15:36.440
Cook for smile.

00:15:37.950 --> 00:15:39.300
Cook with smile.

00:15:39.730 --> 00:15:41.310
Cook for smile.

00:15:42.880 --> 00:15:45.520
Yes. You are absolutely right.

00:15:47.960 --> 00:15:49.060
He can definitely do it.

00:15:49.640 --> 00:15:50.250
Don’t worry.

00:15:50.540 --> 00:15:51.610
I believe him too.

00:15:51.750 --> 00:15:54.090
But without a better idea,

00:15:54.140 --> 00:15:55.920
he cannot defeat Luo Ke.

00:15:56.370 --> 00:15:58.800
What ingredients will he use?

00:16:01.260 --> 00:16:03.170
I cannot lose to the Dark Cooking Society.

00:16:03.910 --> 00:16:05.100
People's smiles.

00:16:05.780 --> 00:16:07.170
The Shanghai Cooking World.

00:16:07.820 --> 00:16:09.970
I will protect them with my own hands.

00:16:16.280 --> 00:16:17.200
That is...

00:16:17.560 --> 00:16:19.010
I’ll use this to compete.

00:16:20.590 --> 00:16:23.400
That is a soft-shelled turtle.

00:16:24.640 --> 00:16:26.710
So, he’ll use the Shanghai’s specialty.

00:16:27.290 --> 00:16:28.530
I’ve never had

00:16:28.590 --> 00:16:29.740
a soft-shelled turtle dish before.

00:16:30.640 --> 00:16:33.020
In Japan, where my mother came from,

00:16:33.120 --> 00:16:36.050
there are truly soft-shelled turtle dishes.

00:16:36.720 --> 00:16:38.100
And also in China.

00:16:38.460 --> 00:16:40.260
But the shell is very hard

00:16:40.310 --> 00:16:41.600
to deal with.

00:16:42.270 --> 00:16:43.830
And a strong earthly smell

00:16:43.880 --> 00:16:45.130
will easily remain.

00:16:45.350 --> 00:16:47.890
It’s a very difficult ingredient to cook.

00:16:48.210 --> 00:16:51.300
Why did he use a soft-shelled turtle?

00:16:51.800 --> 00:16:53.620
Make soup with a soft-shelled turtle?

00:16:54.110 --> 00:16:56.010
What is he going to do?

00:16:57.440 --> 00:16:58.030
Let's fight it out.

00:16:58.480 --> 00:16:59.430
The Dark Cooking Society!

00:17:14.540 --> 00:17:16.000
Awesome. Sanjie.

00:17:17.540 --> 00:17:18.860
In terms of knife skills,

00:17:19.020 --> 00:17:20.570
he is as good as Mao.

00:17:20.900 --> 00:17:22.150
Yes!

00:17:22.440 --> 00:17:24.080
Come on, Sanjie!

00:17:31.080 --> 00:17:33.470
Okay. Both of them have finished.

00:17:34.260 --> 00:17:36.480
Now let the judges taste them.

00:17:36.570 --> 00:17:37.370
First, Luo Ke.

00:17:55.300 --> 00:17:57.150
A whole chicken

00:17:57.240 --> 00:17:58.740
in each soup bowl.

00:17:59.640 --> 00:18:01.480
It’s quite imposing.

00:18:02.460 --> 00:18:04.390
It’s boiled for a while,

00:18:04.440 --> 00:18:05.900
yet the soup is still colorless,

00:18:06.250 --> 00:18:07.850
like plain boiled water.

00:18:11.740 --> 00:18:13.380
There is stuffing inside.

00:18:13.470 --> 00:18:14.690
This is special.

00:18:15.220 --> 00:18:17.570
The chicken breaks with a touch,

00:18:18.110 --> 00:18:20.070
which proves it’s been boiled for a long time.

00:18:21.520 --> 00:18:24.100
But what matters is the taste.

00:18:25.690 --> 00:18:27.630
Listen. The Dark Cooking Society.

00:18:28.280 --> 00:18:29.650
Ordinary dishes

00:18:29.740 --> 00:18:32.110
can’t satisfy our palates.

00:18:38.570 --> 00:18:40.770
The soup looks so thin.

00:19:04.840 --> 00:19:07.550
It tastes great!

00:19:07.680 --> 00:19:09.290
It looks colorless,

00:19:09.520 --> 00:19:11.850
yet many tastes of soups are in it.

00:19:11.900 --> 00:19:12.850
It is such a thick flavor.

00:19:12.900 --> 00:19:14.660
This soup is amazingly tasty.

00:19:17.470 --> 00:19:18.260
Besides,

00:19:19.360 --> 00:19:20.900
the chicken

00:19:21.760 --> 00:19:22.910
fully soaked in the soup

00:19:26.200 --> 00:19:28.150
is one of a kind.

00:19:32.550 --> 00:19:33.500
It looks transparent

00:19:33.550 --> 00:19:35.350
but tastes thick.

00:19:36.240 --> 00:19:38.150
How did he make it?

00:19:40.510 --> 00:19:41.340
Let me teach you.

00:19:41.520 --> 00:19:42.540
The secret is that

00:19:42.870 --> 00:19:44.690
I added egg white in the pot.

00:19:45.150 --> 00:19:47.120
Egg white?

00:19:47.570 --> 00:19:49.350
Add egg white in the pot.

00:19:49.710 --> 00:19:51.470
Let it solidify with other ingredients.

00:19:51.780 --> 00:19:53.460
Then remove it from the soup.

00:19:56.690 --> 00:19:58.840
The transparent and perfect soup is made.

00:19:59.980 --> 00:20:01.510
Then the top soup is finished.

00:20:02.160 --> 00:20:05.380
When the essence of the best ingredients

00:20:05.480 --> 00:20:07.170
seeps into chicken,

00:20:07.920 --> 00:20:09.560
it will be a paradise-like dish,

00:20:09.890 --> 00:20:12.070
the best of the best,

00:20:12.160 --> 00:20:13.360
like the “Emperor”.

00:20:22.520 --> 00:20:24.600
Luo Ke. You are really something.

00:20:25.670 --> 00:20:26.990
Once someone is

00:20:27.040 --> 00:20:28.780
bewitched by his soup,

00:20:28.960 --> 00:20:31.030
he will not take any other soup.

00:20:31.550 --> 00:20:34.230
How should we defeat

00:20:34.280 --> 00:20:35.410
such an amazing soup?

00:20:36.490 --> 00:20:38.960
It would be a tough battle

00:20:39.010 --> 00:20:40.130
even for Mao.

00:20:40.230 --> 00:20:41.190
Don't worry.

00:20:41.530 --> 00:20:42.840
No matter what kind of opponent,

00:20:43.060 --> 00:20:44.730
I believe he will win.

00:20:46.130 --> 00:20:48.470
What kind of soup will he make

00:20:48.520 --> 00:20:50.220
to fight back?

00:20:51.410 --> 00:20:52.100
Sanjie.

00:20:53.480 --> 00:20:54.280
See?

00:20:54.380 --> 00:20:55.920
Loser from Longzhen.

00:20:56.060 --> 00:20:57.480
You still have a chance

00:20:57.530 --> 00:20:58.840
to surrender.

00:20:59.210 --> 00:21:00.170
You better bark

00:21:00.270 --> 00:21:01.990
after the battle.

00:21:02.540 --> 00:21:04.110
What did you say, brat?

00:21:04.600 --> 00:21:06.620
There is a very important point about soup.

00:21:06.730 --> 00:21:08.030
You have no idea at all.

00:21:08.230 --> 00:21:09.770
What? What’s going on?

00:21:10.050 --> 00:21:11.980
I’m gonna show you now.

00:21:12.610 --> 00:21:13.850
This is my soup.

00:21:17.910 --> 00:21:18.750
What is it?

00:21:34.280 --> 00:21:35.730
Is that Hami melon?

00:21:36.600 --> 00:21:38.350
Is the melon the soup?

00:21:45.360 --> 00:21:46.400
What is it?

00:21:46.820 --> 00:21:49.040
What kind of soup has he made?

00:23:15.010 --> 00:23:17.933
Preview of the next episode

00:23:17.933 --> 00:23:19.650
Wait a minute, Sanjie,

00:23:19.982 --> 00:23:22.406
why do you use melon in a soup contest?

00:23:23.148 --> 00:23:26.648
However, this melon had a surprising trick.

00:23:27.441 --> 00:23:29.301
Next episode, Chūka Ichiban!

00:23:29.301 --> 00:23:30.373
Sanjie Special!

00:23:30.499 --> 00:23:32.046
Cold Jelly Soup

00:23:32.313 --> 00:23:33.717
It will definitely be interesting!
